    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Destiny's Sports Page\r\n\r\n*\"I can barely read anything on my page. I wanted it to look bold and dramatic with the team colors, but now the text and the background are basically the same color. I don't understand what went wrong.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. Read Destiny's `vision.md` to understand what they originally asked for.\r\n2. Fix the page using AI Tutor. You can:\r\n   - Update `vision.md` to be more specific, then ask AI Tutor to regenerate the page, **or**\r\n   - Prompt AI Tutor directly to fix specific issues, **or**\r\n   - Do both.\r\n\r\n> **Hint:** Look at how Destiny described the colors in her vision. Think about how you can separate the background color from the text color so they don't conflict - being specific about which element gets which color will help.\r\n\r\nKeep iterating and prompting AI tutor. When the page addresses Destiny's feedback, click **Continue**.",
